247
00:12:53,195 --> 00:12:54,695
Sehemu ya 7: Jinsi ya Kukabiliana na Mvua ya Ghafla

248
00:12:54,695 --> 00:12:59,495
Eeh! Mvua imetoka ghafla.

249
00:12:59,518 --> 00:13:03,518
Ni kweli. Mvua kubwa sana.

250
00:13:03,541 --> 00:13:07,107
Sina mwavuli.

251
00:13:07,130 --> 00:13:11,330
Mimi pia sina. Tumeshindwa.

252
00:13:11,353 --> 00:13:15,753
Tukaa hapa kidogo na tufichie mvua.

253
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:18,143
Sawa.

254
00:13:18,166 --> 00:13:21,933
Lakini inaonekana haitakoma kwa muda.

255
00:13:21,956 --> 00:13:25,289
Kituo cha gari la moshi kiko mbali vipi?

256
00:13:25,312 --> 00:13:29,316
Kutoka hapa ni dakika kumi na tano kwa miguu.

257
00:13:29,339 --> 00:13:32,630
Dakika kumi na tano ni mbali sana.

258
00:13:32,654 --> 00:13:34,220
Tutakauka.

259
00:13:34,243 --> 00:13:37,677
Kuna duka la bidhaa za haraka karibu hapa.

260
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:41,433
Je, naweza kununua mwavuli kwenye duka la bidhaa za haraka?

261
00:13:41,456 --> 00:13:45,307
Ndio, wanauza miavuli ya plastiki.

262
00:13:45,331 --> 00:13:47,664
Miavuli ya plastiki?

263
00:13:47,687 --> 00:13:52,221
Ni miavuli nyeupe na rahisi ya plastiki.

264
00:13:52,244 --> 00:13:54,889
Aa, nimeelewa.

265
00:13:54,912 --> 00:13:58,146
Duka la bidhaa za haraka liko wapi?

266
00:13:58,169 --> 00:14:02,102
Pinda kwenye kona hiyo na utaiona mara moja.

267
00:14:02,125 --> 00:14:05,170
Kama nitakimbia, ni dakika moja tu?

268
00:14:05,194 --> 00:14:09,481
Ndio, ni karibu sana, basi tukimbie.

269
00:14:09,504 --> 00:14:11,237
Nimeelewa.

270
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:13,194
Uko tayari?

271
00:14:13,217 --> 00:14:15,817
Ndio, twende.

272
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,573
Nitakimbia.

273
00:14:17,596 --> 00:14:19,683
Haraka tupige hatua.

274
00:14:19,706 --> 00:14:21,206
Mstari 8: Kukagua vitu vilivyopotea

275
00:14:21,206 --> 00:14:23,102
Samahani.

276
00:14:23,126 --> 00:14:26,782
Je, ni dereva wa teksi tuliyokuwa nayo hapo awali?

277
00:14:26,805 --> 00:14:30,609
Ndiyo, ni mimi. Kuna nini?

278
00:14:30,633 --> 00:14:34,600
Ninaweza nikapoteza pasipoti yangu.

279
00:14:34,623 --> 00:14:37,463
Ilikuwepo ndani ya gari?

280
00:14:37,486 --> 00:14:41,536
Nadhani iko kwenye kiti au sakafuni.

281
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,595
Nimeelewa.

282
00:14:43,619 --> 00:14:47,055
Nitazame kiti cha nyuma kidogo.

283
00:14:47,078 --> 00:14:48,777
Tafadhali.

284
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,267
Ninahangaika sana.

285
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:55,265
Aa, kuna kitu chini ya kiti.

286
00:14:55,288 --> 00:14:57,255
Kweli?

287
00:14:57,278 --> 00:14:59,094
Nionyeshe.

288
00:14:59,118 --> 00:15:01,151
Hii?

289
00:15:01,174 --> 00:15:03,974
Ni kama daftari jekundu.

290
00:15:03,997 --> 00:15:08,442
Hapana, si daftari langu.

291
00:15:08,465 --> 00:15:12,322
Basi, nitaangalia mfukoni wa mlango.

292
00:15:12,346 --> 00:15:14,397
Umeikuta?

293
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:18,063
Hapana, haipo hapa.

294
00:15:18,087 --> 00:15:20,053
Nitafanya nini sasa?

295
00:15:20,076 --> 00:15:23,760
Pasipoti yangu ikiwa imepotea, sitaweza kupanda ndege.

296
00:15:23,783 --> 00:15:28,017
Tafadhali angalia tena ndani ya mfuko wako.

297
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:31,378
Nimeangalia ndani ya mfuko tayari.

298
00:15:31,402 --> 00:15:34,640
Je, kwenye mfuko mdogo?

299
00:15:34,663 --> 00:15:37,152
Mfuko mdogo?

300
00:15:37,176 --> 00:15:39,409
Aa, ipo!

301
00:15:39,432 --> 00:15:41,565
Ipo hapa.

302
00:15:41,588 --> 00:15:43,388
Vizuri sana.

303
00:15:43,411 --> 00:15:45,978
Nimefurahi sana imepatikana.

304
00:15:46,001 --> 00:15:49,134
Samahani sana.

305
00:15:49,157 --> 00:15:50,657
Mstari 9: Jinsi ya kushughulikia maji yanayotoka kwenye choo

306
00:15:50,657 --> 00:15:54,191
Halo, ni kampuni ya usimamizi?

307
00:15:54,214 --> 00:15:56,816
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

308
00:15:56,839 --> 00:15:58,613
Nitusaidie?

309
00:15:58,636 --> 00:16:02,203
Maji ya choo yanatoka bila kusimama.

310
00:16:02,226 --> 00:16:05,294
Maji yanatiririka bila kusimama?

311
00:16:05,317 --> 00:16:09,084
Ndiyo, yanatoka kwa wingi.

312
00:16:09,107 --> 00:16:11,707
Sakafu imevuja maji?

313
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:15,863
Ndiyo, sakafu imojaa maji.

314
00:16:15,886 --> 00:16:17,553
Nimeelewa.

315
00:16:17,576 --> 00:16:21,109
Kwanza, funga bomba kuu la maji.

316
00:16:21,132 --> 00:16:23,699
Bombakuu...?

317
00:16:23,722 --> 00:16:27,522
Samahani, sijui.

318
00:16:27,545 --> 00:16:32,345
Ni handi ndogo inayozima maji.

319
00:16:32,368 --> 00:16:34,934
Iko chini ya tangi la choo.

320
00:16:34,957 --> 00:16:37,557
Chini ya tangi...

321
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,514
Aa, hii?

322
00:16:40,537 --> 00:16:44,070
Lakini ni ngumu, haiendi.

323
00:16:44,093 --> 00:16:46,696
Una zana yoyote?

324
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,795
Zana?

325
00:16:48,818 --> 00:16:53,384
Samahani, sisemi lugha hiyo.

326
00:16:53,407 --> 00:16:57,343
Kama skrubu au spana.

327
00:16:57,367 --> 00:17:00,824
Hapana, sina zana.

328
00:17:00,848 --> 00:17:02,814
Nimeelewa.

329
00:17:02,837 --> 00:17:06,087
Mtu wa kutengeneza atakuja sasa hivi.

330
00:17:06,111 --> 00:17:08,524
Atachukua muda gani kuja?

331
00:17:08,548 --> 00:17:12,036
Unaweza kufika ndani ya nusu saa hivi.

332
00:17:12,059 --> 00:17:14,912
Tafadhali njoo mapema zaidi.

333
00:17:14,935 --> 00:17:17,701
Maji yanatoka chumbani.

334
00:17:17,724 --> 00:17:19,891
Nitakuruhusu uende haraka.

335
00:17:19,914 --> 00:17:22,482
Tafadhali futa maji kwa taulo.

336
00:17:22,506 --> 00:17:24,577
Nimeelewa.

337
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,979
Nitatumia taulo.

338
00:17:27,003 --> 00:17:30,736
Nitakuja mara moja, basi subiri.

339
00:17:30,759 --> 00:17:33,126
Tafadhali nisaidie.

340
00:17:33,149 --> 00:17:34,649
Sehemu ya 10: Jinsi ya Kukabiliana na Tetemeko la Ardhi / How to Respond During an Earthquake

341
00:17:34,649 --> 00:17:37,582
Eeh! Tetemeko la ardhi!

342
00:17:37,605 --> 00:17:39,699
Inatetemeka.

343
00:17:39,723 --> 00:17:41,856
Tulia.

344
00:17:41,879 --> 00:17:45,049
Ingia chini ya meza.

345
00:17:45,073 --> 00:17:48,212
Ninahofia, nifanye nini?

346
00:17:48,235 --> 00:17:50,082
Hakuna matata.

347
00:17:50,106 --> 00:17:52,873
Ficha kichwa chako.

348
00:17:52,896 --> 00:17:56,181
Tetemeko ni kubwa sana.

349
00:17:56,204 --> 00:18:00,541
Litaisha mara moja, basi usihamie.

350
00:18:00,565 --> 00:18:02,898
Litaisha...?

351
00:18:02,921 --> 00:18:07,321
Maana yake tetemeko litakoma.

352
00:18:07,344 --> 00:18:10,615
Aa, imekoma kutetemeka.

353
00:18:10,639 --> 00:18:13,135
Vizuri sana.

354
00:18:13,159 --> 00:18:15,425
Je, umeumia?

355
00:18:15,448 --> 00:18:18,248
Ndio, niko salama.

356
00:18:18,271 --> 00:18:20,838
Lakini ninaogopa.

357
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:23,828
Sasa niende wapi?

358
00:18:23,851 --> 00:18:26,984
Je, ni vyema kutoka nje?

359
00:18:27,007 --> 00:18:31,740
Hapana, nje kuna hatari ya vioo kuvunjika.

360
00:18:31,763 --> 00:18:34,763
Basi, nikae hapa?

361
00:18:34,786 --> 00:18:39,120
Washa televisheni ili tuangalie taarifa.

362
00:18:39,142 --> 00:18:40,909
Taarifa?

363
00:18:40,932 --> 00:18:43,509
Habari.

364
00:18:43,533 --> 00:18:46,171
Tutazame habari za tetemeko.

365
00:18:46,194 --> 00:18:48,527
Nimeelewa.

366
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:50,750
Je, tsunami itakuja?

367
00:18:50,773 --> 00:18:55,632
Hapa ni mbali na bahari, basi tuta salama.

368
00:18:55,655 --> 00:18:57,990
Je, niende kwenye kituo cha dharura?

369
00:18:58,014 --> 00:18:59,947
Kituo cha dharura?

370
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:03,170
Mahali salama.

371
00:19:03,193 --> 00:19:05,360
Tutakwenda shuleni.

372
00:19:05,383 --> 00:19:08,149
Je, unaweza kunijia pamoja?

373
00:19:08,172 --> 00:19:11,572
Ndio, tutakwenda pamoja.

374
00:19:11,595 --> 00:19:13,873
Chukua mizigo yako.

375
00:19:13,897 --> 00:19:15,744
Nimeelewa.

376
00:19:15,767 --> 00:19:18,101
Asante sana.